abstract: >-
  NAAIL OpenLab™ is an independent, non-commercial research and education platform
  for evidence-governed multi-agent and Digital Twin experimentation in accounting,
  auditing, assurance, finance, internal control, sustainability, governance and
  scientific discovery. The platform separates a Stable Knowledge Core™ from a
  Replaceable Technology Core™, and applies provenance, reproducibility,
  falsification, adversarial review, Evidence Passport™ governance and explicit
  human review before material research or professional conclusions. Specialist
  programmes and agents, including ECONOVA-S™, operate within the NAAIL umbrella.
